      "source": "Common interface for managing aliases. Serves as a super-interface for\n<a href=\"../beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于管理别名的通用接口。作为 <a href=\"../beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a> 的超级接口。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the aliases for the given name, if defined.",
      "translation": "如果已定义，则返回给定名称的别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the given name is defined as an alias\n(as opposed to the name of an actually registered component).",
      "translation": "确定给定名称是否被定义为别名（而非实际注册组件的名称）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Given a name, register an alias for it.",
      "translation": "给定一个名称，为其注册一个别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Remove the specified alias from this registry.",
      "translation": "从此注册表中删除指定的别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
