      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果未找到该别名",
